        "TileImage": "$($repository 9c81b545-a234-46c5-9296-54f9f2a0bb6d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.\r\rYour targets are ailing actor Dino Bosco, his agent Sophia Wilde, his Crew assistant Francesca and liscence franchisee Enrico.\r\rHaving spent months within Sapienza Town plaza filming the movie based on cult Graphic Novel &quot;The Icon&quot;, it has caused major financial duress on the local film company subcontracted for this film. Subsequently, it has been annoying a client of ours with the chaos ensuing at his doorstep; Ether BioTech Scientist Silvio Caruso.\r\rCall it a wrap 47.",
